      "connection_topology": {
        "component_connections": "Temp_Monitor publishes Temperature_Sensor_Interface consumed by Motor_Cooling, Battery_Cooling, Cabin_Cooling and Thermal_Optimizer; Thermal_Optimizer invokes PumpControl_Interface and ValveControl_Interface on Pump_Controller and Valve_Controller; Cooling SWCs invoke PumpControl_Interface/ValveControl_Interface as clients; Pump_Controller and Valve_Controller publish actuator status on Cooling_Status_Interface.",
        "data_flow_paths": "Temp_Monitor -> Temperature_Sensor_Interface -> {Thermal_Optimizer, Motor_Cooling, Battery_Cooling, Cabin_Cooling}; Thermal_Optimizer -> PumpControl_Interface/ValveControl_Interface -> {Pump_Controller, Valve_Controller} -> Actuator status -> Cooling_Status_Interface -> Thermal_Optimizer and Cooling SWCs.",
        "control_flow_paths": "Thermal_Optimizer (periodic/event) -> synchronous calls -> Pump_Controller/Valve_Controller -> confirm -> Cooling SWCs adapt local loops; Cooling SWCs (periodic) -> local control -> may call Pump/Valve services for adjustments; Temp_Monitor triggers events to Thermal_Optimizer on rapid temp changes."
      },
      "architecture_rationale": {
        "design_decisions": "采用发布/订阅（温度与状态）与客户端/服务器（执行器命令）混合架构：发布/订阅实现可扩展的多订阅温度分发，客户端/服务器确保命令的同步确认与事务性。将优化逻辑集中在Thermal_Optimizer便于全局调度与策略一致性，局部控制保留以保证基础稳定性和降级能力。Temp_Monitor为单一数据源降低冗余传感复杂性。Pump和Valve分离以便独立扩展驱动和故障隔离。",
        "tradeoff_analysis": "集中优化（优点：一致性、全局最优；缺点：单点复杂度与延迟）与分布式本地控制（优点：低延迟、鲁棒；缺点：可能非全局最优）结合，Thermal_Optimizer负责策略汇总，本地SWC保留低级回路以保证实时性。同步调用保证命令确认但增加延迟，故对非关键命令使用异步调用以降低耦合。",
        "alternative_considerations": "可选将优化逻辑分片到各Cooling SWC以减少中心负载；或增加冗余Temp_Monitor以提高可靠性；对于高可靠场景可将Pump/Valve控制器移入ECU抽象层或CDD以获得更低层硬实时保证。",
        "risk_assessment": "风险包括集中优化器成为性能瓶颈或单点故障；通信超时导致控制失效；传感器故障导致优化错误。缓解措施：设置本地兜底策略、超时与确认机制、监控健康信号并降级到安全模式；在Round2建议增加诊断接口与故障隔离策略。"
      },
